    <main>
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="container">
                <p class="pre-heading">For CEOs and Founders</p>
                <h1>Weak client-facing delivery kills your profit</h1>
                <p class="hero-subheading">Your clients experience your people first. Your product is great, how you deliver it is not.</p>
                <div class="button-group">
                    <a href="#video-section" class="primary-button">Fix these 3 first</a>
                    <a href="#symptoms-section" class="secondary-button">Explore</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="symptoms-section" class="symptoms">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>Broken delivery costs more than you think</h2>
                <p class="symptoms-subheading">The revenue hit is visible. The reputation damage is not. By the time you see it, the client has already decided to leave.</p>
                <ul class="symptoms-list">
                    <li>
                        <div class="symptom-text">Your team says YES to anything</div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
